escribed by law.","phone_agree_disposal":"NC Corporation collects and uses the required inquiry details and mobile phone number to receive/process customer requests and inquiries and provide the results.","email_agreement_contents":{"guest_linw":"▪ Purpose of collection and usage of personal information: Processing inquiries and notifying reply registrations\n▪ Collected personal information: server name, character name, inquiry details, and e-mail address\n▪ Personal information retention period: \n\t<a style='font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; text-decoration: underline'>- Retained for a period prescribed by applicable laws (general inquiries: 3 years; payment-related inquiries: 5 years), then destroyed</a>\n\nYou may refuse to agree on the collection and use of personal information, but doing so may result in inquiry processing and response notifications being restricted.\n※ NC SERVICE is entrusted with processing customer inquiries.","guest_h2":"▪ Purpose of collection and usage of personal information: Processing inquiries and notifying reply registrations\n▪ Collected personal information: server name, game ID, inquiry details, and e-mail address\n▪ Personal information retention period: \n\t<a style='font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; text-decoration: underline'>- Retained for a period prescribed by applicable laws (general inquiries: 3 years; payment-related inquiries: 5 years), then destroyed</a>\n\nYou may refuse to agree on the collection and use of personal information, but doing so may result in inquiry processing and response notifications being restricted.\n※ NC SERVICE is entrusted with processing customer inquiries.","guest":"▪ Purpose of collection and usage of personal information: Processing inquiries and notifying reply registrations\n▪ Collected personal information: inquiry details and e-mail address\n▪ Personal information retention period: \n\t<a style='font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; text-decoration: underline'>- Retained for a period prescribed by applicable laws (general inquiries: 3 years; payment-related inquiries: 5 years), then destroyed</a>\n\nYou may refuse to agree on the collection and use of personal information, but doing so may result in inquiry processing and response notifications being restricted.\n※ NC SERVICE is entrusted with processing customer inquiries.","login_user":"▪ Purpose of collection and usage of personal information: Processing inquiries and notifying reply registrations\n▪ Collected personal information: inquiry details and e-mail address\n▪ Personal information retention period: \n\t<a style='font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; text-decoration: underline'>- Retained for a period prescribed by applicable laws (general inquiries: 3 years; payment-related inquiries: 5 years), then destroyed</a>\n\nYou may refuse to agree on the collection and use of personal information, but doing so may result in inquiry processing and response notifications being restricted.\n※ The e-mail address you provide will only be used to send notification e-mails."},"overseas_transfer_agreement":"Cross-Border Transfer of Personal Information \n\nNC Corporation and its affiliates (“we,” “our,” or “us”) may transfer your personal information across borders, and, to do so, we must obtain your consent per the EU General Data Protection Regulation (“EU GDPR”) and the personal information protection policies of major countries, including that of the Republic of Korea. \n\nUpon your consent, your personal information will be transferred to the Republic of Korea, which is a region that does not currently meet the privacy protection standards of the European Commission and Japan, the region for which the European Commission has adopted the adequacy decision. We will ensure that the personal information subject to such transfer will be used only to the extent necessary to provide in order for us to respond to your 1:1 inquiry and that we shall strictly comply with the protection measures required by the GDPR and the California Consumer Privacy Act of 2018 (“CCPA”), as applicable. The details of such transfer are as follows: \n\n1) - Information Collector: NC Corporation \n    - Transferred Information: e-mail address, language information provided at log-in, the content of your 1:1 inquiry\n    - Receiving Country: Republic of Korea\n    - Time of Transfer and Method: transfer via network at the time of service \n    - Contact: <a href='https://www.plaync.com/policy/privacy/en' target='_blank' style='color:#007fff'>https://help.plaync.com/</a>\n\n2) - Information Collector: NC Corporation \n    - Transferred Information: e-mail address, language information provided at log-in \n    - Receiving Country: Japan(AWS Tokyo Region)\n    - Time of Transfer and Method: transfer via network at the time of send e-mail\n    - Contact: <a href='https://aws.amazon.com/compliance/contact/' target='_blank' style='color:#007fff'>https://aws.amazon.com/compliance/contact/</a>\n\nShould you wish to withdraw your consent to the cross-border transfer of personal information herein, you may do so at any time by contacting us at <a href='https://www.plaync.com/policy/privacy/en' target='_blank' style='color:#007fff'>https://help.plaync.com</a>. Please be aware that upon withdrawal of your consent, the services we provide to you may be limited or restricted.","global_account_consent_previous_history":"History Prior to Global Account Consent","non_member_inquiry_guide":"For inquiries related to %s,\nyou need to go to a separate page.\nContinue?","smsNotificationGuide":"You can receive updates about your inquiry via SMS. If you agree to data collection, please enter your phone number."},"submitComplete":{"notice":"We will do our best to respond to your report as soon as possible. Please be aware that the process can be delayed under certain circumstances.","notice_identify":"Additional authentication may be required depending on the type of question, so please check the processing status.","q